#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
LEGION MANAGER PRODUCTION v4.0 — Denaro Core Trading Engine
============================================================
CHANGES FROM v3:
  ✅ Fix: crash on startup when no exchanges configured (graceful exit)
  ✅ Fix: OHLCV 1m candles for indicators (not tick data — RSI/EMA on ticks was WRONG)
  ✅ Fix: Commission-aware TP/SL (0.2% round-trip fee buffer)
  ✅ Fix: Volume filter — skip low-volume / dead-market periods
  ✅ Fix: Trading hours filter — skip 03:00-07:00 UTC (low liquidity)
  ✅ Fix: RSI NaN protection with epsilon clamp
  ✅ Fix: Trailing stop + breakeven (move SL to entry + fee after 1.5x profit)
  ✅ Fix: MIN_NOTIONAL guard per Binance LOT_SIZE filter
  ✅ Fix: Rate limit protection — batch balance checks, exponential backoff
  ✅ Fix: Multi-strategy engine — DIP_BUY, MOMENTUM, MEAN_REVERSION
  ✅ NEW: Adaptive position sizing (Kelly-based, auto-adjusts to win rate)
  ✅ NEW: Symbol-level performance tracking (disable losers automatically)
  ✅ NEW: Market regime detection (trending / ranging / volatile)
  ✅ NEW: State persistence via SQLite with WAL mode (no more JSON corruption)
"""

